  "description": "The native payload for Vonage's OpenTok media transformers (com.vonage:client-sdk-video-transformers 2.34.1 and the ML libraries it declares), packaged for .NET for Android. Enables background blur, background replacement and audio noise suppression. Add it alongside OpenTok.Net.Android — it carries no managed API of its own; the classes that turn it on, PublisherKit.VideoTransformer and PublisherKit.AudioTransformer, are in that package. Without this one they return null and raise MediaTransformerOpenTokTransformersLibraryNotLoaded at runtime.",
